2026-10-02T09:33:37-07:00
gomad: add the choice-exploration start ordinal
- `explore --choice-start-ordinal N` (choice-exploration only) never
  expands a replay-plan decision before N, counts --max-choice-depth from
  N, and excludes earlier decisions from the omitted-by-depth count
- the start is part of the engine configuration, Campaign plan, and
  resume validation; zero encodes as before, pinned by retained state
  identities, plan bytes, and a journal written before the change
- a start at or past the root trace ends with stop=choice_start_unreached
  instead of looking like an exhausted search
- `inspect --choices` lists replay-plan decision ordinals, kinds, and
  site offsets (choice-inspection/v3)

